<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ AUG NET SWINGS TO LOSS PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ AUG NET SWINGS TO LOSS PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.43 vs   0.09 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.33 vs   0.15 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.63 vs   1.28 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    8.52 vs   7.33</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 5.57 vs   0.71 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   5.48 vs   1.91 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.72 vs   7.59	 </p>
<p> Sales		   66.01 vs  62.83</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedz SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
